1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:05,780
We're setting up a new location: the Indirect Material Inspection station.

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:12,302
One workbench, one material cart, one magnifying lamp, and seats for 1 or 2 operators.

3
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:20,251
The bench is 1550 mm long, 750 deep, and 2200 tall.

4
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:27,280
A blue, powder-coated steel frame carries a 25 mm white laminate top.

5
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:33,170
On the left, a stainless steel cart brings material in, and takes it back when the check is done.

6
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:42,627
The LED panel reaches 700 mm forward, on angled brackets, lighting the whole worktop.

7
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:50,103
At the left rear corner, an ESD magnifying lamp swings over the center, for close visual checks.

8
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:57,180
Above, a full-length cabinet, with one wide door and a key lock, keeps tools and samples secure.

9
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:00,137
Along the back, a 4-outlet power rail.

10
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:07,277
Two blue ESD chairs, with foot rings and casters, seat 1 or 2 operators.

11
00:01:09,950 --> 00:01:14,331
One location. Everything the inspector needs, within reach.
